        "content": "## DNA — Client Onboarding Automation\n\n**Trigger:** Invoice Status = Done on Agreements board\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Verify Monday webhook challenge\n2. Check Invoice Status = Done\n3. Get Agreement details from Monday\n4. Create Client Database entry\n5. Duplicate Campaign Calendar template\n6. Create Slack channel + invite team\n7. Create Google Drive folder + subfolders\n8. Notify Account Director",
